/1083070/extras/5a5484385568452e7fb8a05dad190c53.mp4?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>A rookie without training is a dead rookie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>WORKING UNDER PRESSURE OF TIME</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/0163a772bcd7b550e9386c6e0cceecef.poster.avif?t=1728898792\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/0163a772bcd7b550e9386c6e0cceecef.webm?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/0163a772bcd7b550e9386c6e0cceecef.mp4?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Nerves of steel are a must in this job. No shaky hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>FINDING THE BOMBS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/6b37375e5850d6495ca72b0abadb989f.poster.avif?t=1728898792\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/6b37375e5850d6495ca72b0abadb989f.webm?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1083070/extras/6b37375e5850d6495ca72b0abadb989f.mp4?t=1728898792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>If you want to defuse the bomb, first you need to find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong> DEFUSING THE BOMBS AND MINES</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor